<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Employee created</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head><body class="login-body"><main class="login-card wide"><a class="brand" href="/admin">🍲 <span>Goan Craving<small>ADMIN CONSOLE</small></span></a><div class="success-mark">✓</div><h1>Employee created</h1><p class="muted">Share these temporary credentials with the employee through a secure channel. This password is shown only once.</p><div class="credential"><small>Employee ID</small><b><%= employee.employeeId %></b><button class="button-light copy" data-copy="<%= employee.employeeId %>">Copy</button></div><div class="credential"><small>Email</small><b><%= employee.email %></b><button class="button-light copy" data-copy="<%= employee.email %>">Copy</button></div><div class="credential"><small>Temporary password</small><b><%= temporaryPassword %></b><button class="button-light copy" data-copy="<%= temporaryPassword %>">Copy</button></div><p class="hint">The employee record stores a password hash, not the original password. Employee sign-in and forced password change need to be connected to the order dashboard.</p><a class="primary button-link" href="/admin/employees">Back to employees</a></main><script>document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(b.dataset.copy);b.textContent='Copied'});</script></body></html>
